# Stunt mode with the shortest timer (pak flow; w28r): stunt_end.press's end-of-stunt screens in 3600 frames
# instead of 11000. SELECT MODE DOWN x4 (STUNT); SELECT TRACK (16 s; STUNT 1): DOWN to MINUTES, LEFT x4 = 1 (default 5);
# gas held from 30 s; the timer ends at frame 2810: GAME OVER (SCOREBOARD, RACE AGAIN, NEW TRACK, NEW CAR, QUIT; POINTS,
# BEST STUNT) alternating with the stunt table (BACK FLIP ... AIR TIME); A/B on SCOREBOARD, then RACE AGAIN.
# Reaches the stunt results code (func_80101D84, func_80102448 and their callers, as stunt_end).
frames 3600
pak on
4 START
7 A
10 A
12 DOWN
13 DOWN
14 DOWN
15 DOWN
16 A
18 DOWN
